    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/33-donore-avenue-south-circular-rd-d8-south-circular-road-dublin-d08-y7n6\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 33 Donore Avenue, South Circular Road.\r\n\r\nNestled on the charming Donore Avenue, this unique detached property offers a tranquil retreat amidst the vibrant South Circular Road area in Dublin. With no neighbours on either side, it enjoys uninterrupted views of serene church gardens, providing a sense of peaceful seclusion in the heart of the city. The architectural style is traditional with a classic facade that harmoniously blends with the surroundings. The exterior features a neat pathway leading to the entrance, flanked by modest shrubbery, creating a welcoming ambience.\r\n\r\nInside, the property unfolds into a well-proportioned space, ideal for those seeking a compact urban dwelling. The main living area is bright and airy, enhanced by dual aspect windows that flood the room with natural light. The absence of a fireplace gives it a modern touch, while the open layout offers versatility in furniture arrangement. The kitchen, conveniently located off the living area, is compact yet functional, equipped with modern cabinetry and ample countertop space.\r\n\r\nThe bedroom is spacious and includes a large window with garden views, promoting tranquillity and relaxation. The property includes a separate well-appointed bathroom with contemporary fittings.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the charming interiors, this property offers a private outdoor area perfect for a small patio or garden space, enhancing its appeal for those who enjoy a touch of nature.\r\n\r\nLocated in a well-connected area, it is within a 15-minute walk of numerous bus routes and the LUAS line, offering easy access to Dublin's extensive transport network. Nearby amenities include a selection of schools, shops, and leisure facilities, making it a convenient choice for young  or as a lucrative investment opportunity. This property is ideally suited for first-time buyers or those looking to downsize without compromising on location or style."
      },
